one/rclone/commits/3087c5d559042d87ef2030dbd5e1ec50368bc2ff","created_at":"2019-06-15T10:10:57Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/502354016","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/3263#issuecomment-502354016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/3263","id":502354016,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwMjM1NDAxNg==","user":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/536803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw","html_url":"https://github.com/ncw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-06-15T10:13:30Z","updated_at":"2019-06-15T10:13:30Z","body":"I've made webdav retry on 423 errors and I've stuck that in [the latest beta](https://beta.rclone.org) (uploaded in 15-30 mins) which is shortly to become v1.48.  This is controlled by the --low-level-retries flag.\r\n\r\nI haven't merged the delete fix yet as I want to work on it some more after the 1.48 release but I think the retry on 423 will probably fix the issue...\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/502354016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_g